e","timestamp":"2026-07-20T21:38:24.000Z","url":"https://x.com/Corey_Bender/status/2079320042269720644","handle":"Corey_Bender","writerName":"Corey Bender"},{"text":"Swamp Party 2k26 is underway 🤫 📸 \n\n@VB3_9 | #GoGators https://t.co/s3yXBQfURe","source":"UF Official","timestamp":"2026-07-20T19:52:51.000Z","url":"https://x.com/GatorsFB/status/2079293478660346176","handle":"GatorsFB","writerName":"Florida Gators Football"},{"text":"After covering Florida recruiting, there are certain recruitments that stick with you long after the commitment graphic drops.\n\nThese are five from the 2027 cycle we won't forget…\n\nDETAILS: https://t.co/8db8Skg03k (On3+) https://t.co/c5bxNDA702","source":"Gators Online / On3","timestamp":"2026-07-20T19:14:00.000Z","url":"https://x.com/GatorsOnline/status/2079283702463373481","handle":"GatorsOnline","writerName":"Gators Online"},{"text":"Missouri coach calls ‘The Swamp’ one of top 15 stadiums in the world. \n\nSTORY: https://t.co/dlcYMy90M0 https://t.co/OTWj4trUz7","source":"Gators Online / On3","timestamp":"2026-07-20T18:47:43.000Z","url":"https://x.com/ZachAbolverdi/status/2079277088876474390","handle":"ZachAbolverdi","writerName":"Zach Abolverdi"},{"text":"Some commitments were expected. Others made you stop and say, \"Florida really did that?\"\n\nThe stories behind these five recruiting wins were just as memorable as the players themselves..\n\nDETAILS 👀: https://t.co/EQ0GNL2sPI (On3+) https://t.co/dHbrJzs39F","source":"On3 / Gators Online","timestamp":"2026-07-20T16:27:52.000Z","url":"https://x.com/Corey_Bender/status/2079241892504519009","handle":"Corey_Bender","writerName":"Corey Bender"},{"text":"The Ultimate @GatorsFB Time Machine: Florida’s 60 greatest plays of the last six decades.\n\nEvery highlight. Every ranking. Every story.\n\nTake a trip down memory lane and relive each play + 10 bonus plays &amp; 60 honorable mentions.\n\nHere are my top 15.\n\nFREE: https://t.co/kXtN1j7lv7 https://t.co/35hsFcHCs8","source":"Gators Online / On3","timestamp":"2026-07-20T15:08:56.000Z","url":"https://x.com/ZachAbolverdi/status/2079222028263997859","handle":"ZachAbolverdi","writerName":"Zach Abolverdi"}],"staffNotes":[{"text":"New episode: Gators Breakdown — SEC Media Days: Greg Sankey Sells the 9-Game Schedule — Coaches Aren’t Buying It | Gators Preview","source":"rss","timestamp":"2026-07-21T00:22:00.000Z"},{"text":"OnlyGators: Florida #Gators at SEC Media Days: RB Jadan Baugh, LB Myles Graham and WR Vernell Brown Jr. will join coach Jon Sumrall","source":"x","timestamp":"2026-07-14T16:03:11.000Z"},{"text":"{{ coach.HC }}'s First 6 Months: A Real Assessment","source":"content","timestamp":"2026-07-14T15:00:00.000Z"},{"text":"The 3-3-5 Revolution: Why {{ coach.DC }}'s Scheme Changes Everything","source":"content","timestamp":"2026-07-12T18:00:00.000Z"}]}}
